WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:15.765
<i>I always knew Ko Geum was a little weird.</i>

2
00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:17.892
{\an8}5 YEARS AGO, WINTER

3
00:00:17.976 --> 00:00:20.437
{\an8}Hello. Congratulations.

4
00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.105
{\an8}- Good morning.
- Hello.

5
00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:24.983
Congratulations, Assistant Director Puck.

6
00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:28.028
- Did they call you today?
- No.

7
00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:30.238
But you come every day.

8
00:00:31.197 --> 00:00:32.991
Do you like being here?

9
00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:35.702
You are a fanatic.

10
00:00:38.038 --> 00:00:41.124
I adore I like it very much.

11
00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:45.462
<i>Everyone who knew Ko Gyom thought so too.</i>

12
00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:54.554
I asked not to do this.

13
00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:56.890
But why? Am I not allowed to help?

14
00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.018
This is no help.

15
00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:03.354
I don't want to be gossiped about.

16
00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:06.608
So give me peace.

17
00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:08.193
But no one...

18
00:01:11.946 --> 00:01:13.782
I guess you got it.

19
00:01:17.994 --> 00:01:21.998
<i>I thought,</i>
<i>that he will finally give me peace.</i>

20
00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:24.084
<i>But...</i>

21
00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:25.835
{\an8}ONE OF EACH!

22
00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.506
Nothing left?

23
00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:39.307
I am the director here. You didn't leave anything for me?

24
00:01:40.558 --> 00:01:44.604
You said you wouldn't eat anything
because you are too nervous on the court.

25
00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:46.773
You literally screamed.

26
00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:49.526
I didn't… I didn't scream.

27
00:01:50.902 --> 00:01:53.530
Why wasn't it sent?
enough snacks for everyone?

28
00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:55.865
Are we on a tight budget?

29
00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:00.787
Nothing left?

30
00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.207
I was late.

31
00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:08.128
Do not chew here.

32
00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:53.006
Sorry.

33
00:02:53.715 --> 00:02:54.966
- Kim Mubi.
- Have you arrived?

34
00:02:55.049 --> 00:02:57.468
Shall we switch places?

35
00:02:57.552 --> 00:02:58.803
What?

36
00:02:58.887 --> 00:03:01.431
Why? What is it, Goem?

37
00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:04.976
We haven't finished our conversation.

38
00:03:05.059 --> 00:03:07.562
I still have a few questions. Well, because

39
00:03:14.444 --> 00:03:15.945
I thought we had arrived.

40
00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:24.954
- What is it?
- What?

41
00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:26.664
Ha?

42
00:03:26.748 --> 00:03:27.749
Sleep-sleep

43
00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.127
can i sleep

44
00:04:07.664 --> 00:04:09.749
Can someone help me?

45
00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:11.251
Yes.

46
00:04:11.334 --> 00:04:13.169
Now. I will help!

47
00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:19.509
Mr. Ma ordered it to be postponed.

48
00:04:19.592 --> 00:04:21.594
OK. And this?

49
00:04:23.554 --> 00:04:26.224
- No, let's postpone it first.
- First this.

50
00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:32.522
<i>Maybe I'm the weird one, not Ko Gyeom?</i>

51
00:04:38.027 --> 00:04:39.445
That's about work.

52
00:04:40.697 --> 00:04:42.365
OK. That's all for today.

53
00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:45.618
That's all for today!

54
00:04:45.702 --> 00:04:47.287
- We are finishing!
- Let's roll up!

55
00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.997
- Let's roll up!
- All well done.

56
00:04:49.747 --> 00:04:50.665
Great work!

57
00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.712
"WEALTH AND PROSPERITY"
REQUISITES

58
00:05:15.565 --> 00:05:18.568
"WEALTH AND PROSPERITY"
FILMING CANCELED DUE TO SNOW FALL

59
00:05:24.699 --> 00:05:26.909
The snow will have to be shoveled tomorrow.

60
00:05:35.001 --> 00:05:38.087
<i>He was as carefree as always.</i>

61
00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:47.138
Why are you taking so long?

62
00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:50.058
Everyone left long ago.

63
00:05:50.767 --> 00:05:52.977
- Were you waiting for me?
- Yes.

64
00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:54.020
Why?

65
00:05:55.271 --> 00:05:56.272
To pick you up

66
00:06:02.362 --> 00:06:04.030
It was not possible?

67
00:06:05.615 --> 00:06:09.285
<i>But now</i>
<i>I begin to look at everything differently.</i>

68
00:06:09.369 --> 00:06:10.203
Why?

69
00:06:10.953 --> 00:06:12.121
I like you.

70
00:06:18.252 --> 00:06:19.712
Is this one of your lines?

71
00:06:19.796 --> 00:06:21.798
You know that I have no words.

72
00:06:22.632 --> 00:06:27.804
<i>I thought that its simplicity -</i>
<i>this is proof of his sincerity.</i>

73
00:06:34.519 --> 00:06:35.853
I like you.

74
00:06:41.484 --> 00:06:42.985
Is it forbidden?

75
00:06:44.195 --> 00:06:46.364
<i>Maybe that's why I fell for him.</i>

76
00:06:50.868 --> 00:06:52.036
Mubi.

77
00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:52.954
<i>But...</i>

78
00:06:53.746 --> 00:06:54.580
I…

79
00:06:58.501 --> 00:07:00.128
I want you to like me again.

80
00:07:10.179 --> 00:07:11.597
<i>…that's wrong.</i>

81
00:07:13.975 --> 00:07:16.519
Don't talk nonsense.

82
00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:25.027
<i>It would be foolish to do it twice.</i>

83
00:07:25.111 --> 00:07:25.987
Kim Mubi!

84
00:07:28.197 --> 00:07:31.492
<i>I will never do such a pathetic thing again.</i>

85
00:07:36.289 --> 00:07:37.874
EPISODE 5

86
00:07:37.957 --> 00:07:44.630
NO ONE CAN PREPARE
LOVE AND FEAR YOU

87
00:07:50.511 --> 00:07:52.847
What is it? Are you planning to rob your neighbors?

88
00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.724
I need something.

89
00:07:55.349 --> 00:07:57.477
That's why I'm thinking how to get it.

90
00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:00.771
I haven't seen that sparkle in my eyes for a long time.

91
00:08:01.772 --> 00:08:03.649
I'm talking about a girl who lives there.

92
00:08:03.733 --> 00:08:05.610
Like a good girl.

93
00:08:06.819 --> 00:08:10.239
Have you seen Kim Mubi? Did you know about her?

94
00:08:10.323 --> 00:08:11.157
What?

95
00:08:11.866 --> 00:08:15.495
What is the girl you were chasing
a few years ago, - our neighbor?

96
00:08:15.578 --> 00:08:18.956
Even the neighborhood kids know
that you like her

97
00:08:22.502 --> 00:08:23.669
What's stopping you?

98
00:08:31.260 --> 00:08:32.428
It's because of me...

99
00:08:32.512 --> 00:08:34.263
No.

100
00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:40.019
I swear, not because of you, but because of me.

101
00:08:40.686 --> 00:08:43.439
And more importantly, she hates me.

102
00:08:44.857 --> 00:08:47.193
Like many people on the Internet.

103
00:08:47.276 --> 00:08:48.945
I don't care about that.

104
00:08:49.028 --> 00:08:53.032
A star always has
many fans and haters.

105
00:08:55.284 --> 00:08:56.118
However

106
00:08:57.537 --> 00:08:59.997
I don't want Mubi to hate me.

107
00:09:05.086 --> 00:09:05.920
What is it?

108
00:09:06.504 --> 00:09:09.674
"I don't want Mubi to hate me."
are you nine

109
00:09:09.757 --> 00:09:11.592
what's wrong with you

110
00:09:11.676 --> 00:09:14.011
You know nothing! what do you know

111
00:09:14.095 --> 00:09:15.263
what's wrong with you

112
00:09:26.023 --> 00:09:27.316
You have a problem.

113
00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:29.569
Why does he come out again?

114
00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.077
The poor boy wanted to go home

115
00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.037
and you didn't let him sleep.

116
00:09:41.163 --> 00:09:45.334
Playing video games is the best way
distract from thoughts.

117
00:09:45.418 --> 00:09:47.420
Where is Jung Hoo? Already gone?

118
00:09:48.546 --> 00:09:50.506
He said he would be back soon.

119
00:09:56.512 --> 00:10:00.349
<i>I could just ignore</i>
<i>words by Ko Gyom.</i>

120
00:10:05.354 --> 00:10:07.481
<i>And instead I lost sleep.</i>

121
00:10:22.246 --> 00:10:24.957
It's like a memory from the past.

122
00:10:26.083 --> 00:10:29.587
Why did you come out again?
And at such a time!

123
00:10:31.589 --> 00:10:34.717
Mubi and I all night...

124
00:10:35.301 --> 00:10:38.137
I thought we got along last time.

125
00:10:39.347 --> 00:10:40.181
What?

126
00:10:40.264 --> 00:10:43.934
I asked not to go to her just like that.
If you don't have friends

127
00:10:44.644 --> 00:10:47.146
I'll hang out with you, I said.

128
00:10:52.276 --> 00:10:55.112
It's not interesting with you. Without insults.

129
00:10:56.072 --> 00:10:57.114
Wait!

130
00:10:57.740 --> 00:10:59.408
You make me sad.

131
00:10:59.492 --> 00:11:02.870
Last time you stayed
I have five hours at home.

132
00:11:02.953 --> 00:11:05.414
It's called having a good time.

133
00:11:05.498 --> 00:11:06.957
We had fun!

134
00:11:11.253 --> 00:11:15.675
You are obsessed with me
because of my baby girl, right?

135
00:11:28.062 --> 00:11:30.231
You are not her type at all.

136
00:11:30.314 --> 00:11:31.232
What?

137
00:11:32.274 --> 00:11:35.027
But what do you know, little potato...

138
00:11:35.986 --> 00:11:40.116
Mubi said that a psycho lives opposite.

139
00:11:41.492 --> 00:11:42.868
Why should I help you?

140
00:11:42.952 --> 00:11:45.121
What? Psycho?

141
00:11:46.038 --> 00:11:46.997
Did Mubi say that?

142
00:11:47.081 --> 00:11:48.499
- Yes.
- About me?

143
00:11:48.582 --> 00:11:51.293
U Jung Hoo, go eat breakfast!

144
00:11:51.794 --> 00:11:52.795
Where is he?

145
00:11:55.339 --> 00:11:57.174
- Jeong Hoo, go eat!
- Good.

146
00:11:58.884 --> 00:12:00.636
- At Jung Hoo!
- What, Mubi?

147
00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:02.722
- Go already.
- I'm going

148
00:12:06.267 --> 00:12:08.853
Goem, you're not her type.

149
00:12:09.854 --> 00:12:10.771
Oh you...

150
00:12:13.566 --> 00:12:15.484
- What were you doing there?
- A slipper.

151
00:12:15.568 --> 00:12:17.737
There was a very ugly cat.

152
00:12:30.082 --> 00:12:32.918
{\an8}"MELODY"

153
00:12:42.428 --> 00:12:45.931
{\an8}SCREENWRITER: SONG CHU A
DIRECTOR: KIM MUBY

154
00:13:00.738 --> 00:13:03.657
Why does she keep coming here?
So annoying.

155
00:13:14.084 --> 00:13:16.212
I don't know what you said at first

156
00:13:16.295 --> 00:13:20.216
but the last words were
"so annoying," director Kim.

157
00:13:21.592 --> 00:13:22.885
Do you read lips?

158
00:13:23.969 --> 00:13:24.804
Impressive.

159
00:13:26.222 --> 00:13:29.099
I don't want to be here either
but I am on important business.

160
00:13:31.644 --> 00:13:32.478
What is it?

161
00:13:32.561 --> 00:13:34.480
He agreed to write the music.

162
00:13:34.563 --> 00:13:38.067
Let me remind you. I have to listen first.

163
00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:41.612
Okay, I understand. But you will like it.

164
00:13:43.113 --> 00:13:46.200
It's like you parted ways badly.
Are you sure about this?

165
00:13:47.076 --> 00:13:50.162
It will be necessary constantly
communicate at work,

166
00:13:50.871 --> 00:13:52.706
and you will end up fighting.

167
00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:56.043
I apologize, of course, but we are all adults.

168
00:13:56.126 --> 00:13:58.712
Argue with a colleague -
it's kind of childish.

169
00:14:00.422 --> 00:14:01.590
Let's see.

170
00:14:05.594 --> 00:14:06.929
What is it?

171
00:14:08.180 --> 00:14:09.723
Looking for a place to shoot?

172
00:14:10.432 --> 00:14:11.976
Prompt?

173
00:14:13.018 --> 00:14:13.853
aren't you going

174
00:14:13.936 --> 00:14:17.940
When I think we've got it together
you're acting like we're strangers again.

175
00:14:18.023 --> 00:14:19.316
bye

176
00:14:22.945 --> 00:14:24.071
Come on.

177
00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:29.952
Greetings! Goem, come here!

178
00:14:31.495 --> 00:14:33.247
You saw each other last time.

179
00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.666
I didn't have a chance to say hello properly.

180
00:14:35.749 --> 00:14:38.878
Nice to meet you.
It must have been difficult for you.

181
00:14:38.961 --> 00:14:41.005
- Do you want a drink?
- Yes, of course.

182
00:14:41.088 --> 00:14:43.757
he's not like that
but you know how people are.

183
00:14:44.341 --> 00:14:47.011
He got it because of a simple misunderstanding.

184
00:14:47.094 --> 00:14:51.307
Yes, I saw director Ku's interview.
What an untimely coincidence.

185
00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:53.392
You probably thought it was unfair.

186
00:14:53.475 --> 00:14:54.894
Not entirely unfair.

187
00:14:56.145 --> 00:14:57.855
The review was too harsh.

188
00:14:57.938 --> 00:14:59.899
I didn't think it was unfair.

189
00:15:00.649 --> 00:15:01.734
Pour you?

190
00:15:09.533 --> 00:15:10.451
Thank you.

191
00:15:10.534 --> 00:15:13.203
And now let's drink. Cheers!

192
00:15:23.422 --> 00:15:25.758
Printed text has limitations.

193
00:15:25.841 --> 00:15:29.428
It does not convey facial expressions
and the tone of the author's voice,

194
00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:33.933
so I realized I could give up
more hostile than one would like.

195
00:15:35.601 --> 00:15:38.437
Perhaps that is why my articles are not perfect.

196
00:15:40.064 --> 00:15:44.526
If I were to review your movie

197
00:15:45.527 --> 00:15:49.698
live in front of you, with a smile on your face,

198
00:15:49.782 --> 00:15:53.243
you probably wouldn't be so offended.

199
00:15:54.119 --> 00:15:54.954
That's why I'm asking

200
00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.165
your understanding

201
00:16:07.049 --> 00:16:07.883
And what did I say?

202
00:16:07.967 --> 00:16:11.011
He seems rude
but he is a decent guy.

203
00:16:11.637 --> 00:16:14.139
Let's drink and forget about all resentments.

204
00:16:15.057 --> 00:16:17.893
He got it anyway.

205
00:16:17.977 --> 00:16:19.728
- Let's be!
- Let's be!

206
00:16:33.659 --> 00:16:35.244
wait Allow me.

207
00:16:47.089 --> 00:16:48.757
- Are you all right?
- Yes.

208
00:16:49.883 --> 00:16:52.970
Thank you. I am in your debt again.

209
00:16:55.973 --> 00:16:56.807
Please.

210
00:17:05.858 --> 00:17:07.359
But to him!

211
00:17:07.443 --> 00:17:11.947
You cannot occupy the entire lane.
Don't you see how narrow it is?

212
00:17:12.531 --> 00:17:13.699
Sorry.

213
00:17:13.782 --> 00:17:16.535
Motorcycle beat! You will pay me!

214
00:17:16.618 --> 00:17:19.288
Sir! I saw everything.

215
00:17:19.371 --> 00:17:22.041
What do you say to a person who has just been beaten up?

216
00:17:22.124 --> 00:17:24.752
What? Did I knock him down?

217
00:17:24.835 --> 00:17:26.587
He himself flew at me!

218
00:17:26.670 --> 00:17:30.424
I saw
how that thing hit that man in the arm.

219
00:17:30.507 --> 00:17:31.759
Apologize to him!

220
00:17:31.842 --> 00:17:33.969
Why should I?

221
00:17:34.053 --> 00:17:36.180
you either apologize

222
00:17:36.263 --> 00:17:38.599
or appear in court
and compensate him for the damage.

223
00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:42.394
Sorry.

224
00:17:42.478 --> 00:17:45.773
I was just distracted.

225
00:17:45.856 --> 00:17:47.191
And this, in your opinion, is sincere?

226
00:17:50.944 --> 00:17:54.740
I am sincerely sorry.
I didn't realize I had touched you.

227
00:17:55.240 --> 00:17:57.493
Nothing. Everything is fine.

228
00:17:58.494 --> 00:17:59.411
Thank you.

229
00:18:01.246 --> 00:18:02.664
Sorry.

230
00:18:16.053 --> 00:18:17.137
Are you OK?

231
00:18:18.347 --> 00:18:19.181
Yes.

232
00:18:24.812 --> 00:18:26.480
You are always so kind.

233
00:18:27.773 --> 00:18:28.607
I

234
00:18:29.358 --> 00:18:33.112
your mother is also kind.

235
00:18:34.863 --> 00:18:36.281
my mother

236
00:18:37.282 --> 00:18:38.867
It doesn't look like her.

237
00:18:40.077 --> 00:18:42.162
Well, not friendly,

238
00:18:42.996 --> 00:18:45.499
but even though she has a gloomy look...

239
00:18:47.793 --> 00:18:48.961
You are very similar.

240
00:18:57.219 --> 00:18:59.221
And you don't look like your brother at all.

241
00:18:59.972 --> 00:19:03.892
You seem so attentive and he…

242
00:19:03.976 --> 00:19:04.977
Too indifferent?

243
00:19:06.979 --> 00:19:10.566
Probably not bad
talk about him in front of his brother

244
00:19:10.649 --> 00:19:14.486
but he really is too indifferent.

245
00:19:15.863 --> 00:19:17.030
That's why it's attractive.

246
00:19:18.824 --> 00:19:21.618
There is nothing attractive about that guy.

247
00:19:23.662 --> 00:19:28.750
Does your brother always take everything as a joke?

248
00:19:29.626 --> 00:19:31.628
He seems too carefree.

249
00:19:33.255 --> 00:19:34.256
But sometimes...

250
00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:38.760
when you carry a heavy burden…

251
00:19:40.679 --> 00:19:42.389
you try to make it easy

252
00:19:43.682 --> 00:19:46.101
because you can't handle it.

253
00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:51.106
I wish he was carefree.

254
00:19:54.693 --> 00:19:58.697
But he is not like that, and that worries me a lot.

255
00:20:16.089 --> 00:20:16.924
Chun Tae.

256
00:20:18.133 --> 00:20:19.384
Of course. Good.

257
00:20:28.185 --> 00:20:29.770
Why are you doing this?

258
00:20:34.274 --> 00:20:35.359
Because...

259
00:20:37.486 --> 00:20:38.820
i love cinema

260
00:20:40.072 --> 00:20:42.324
And somehow it turned out that way.

261
00:20:44.743 --> 00:20:46.328
Like everyone else in the industry.

262
00:20:47.537 --> 00:20:49.790
We all love movies.

263
00:20:51.792 --> 00:20:54.628
Yes, cinema is fascinating.

264
00:20:55.504 --> 00:20:56.338
Apparently.

265
00:21:03.845 --> 00:21:04.930
but you know

266
00:21:05.847 --> 00:21:07.182
enough of me

267
00:21:08.183 --> 00:21:09.017
What?

268
00:21:10.269 --> 00:21:13.397
I'm crazy about movies like everyone else

269
00:21:14.398 --> 00:21:18.277
but i feel like i'm gonna hate him
if i continue

270
00:21:20.237 --> 00:21:22.281
After reading your review

271
00:21:22.364 --> 00:21:24.449
and looking around,

272
00:21:25.951 --> 00:21:28.328
I realized that I lack talent.

273
00:21:30.539 --> 00:21:32.749
At first I didn't care.

274
00:21:33.709 --> 00:21:36.253
But lately I feel

275
00:21:38.672 --> 00:21:40.257
strength to throw everything.

276
00:21:45.971 --> 00:21:49.808
It's not because of what you wrote
so don't worry.

277
00:21:51.393 --> 00:21:54.646
I just want to leave everything…

278
00:21:56.481 --> 00:22:01.236
while I still like the movie.

279
00:22:20.839 --> 00:22:21.840
I'm drunk as a chip.

280
00:22:26.928 --> 00:22:28.430
You should not do this.

281
00:22:32.642 --> 00:22:33.477
Mubi

282
00:22:36.104 --> 00:22:37.856
No. Koh Gome.

283
00:22:38.857 --> 00:22:39.775
Go Goem!

284
00:22:41.777 --> 00:22:43.028
Yes, you must.

285
00:22:45.197 --> 00:22:46.365
Only once.

286
00:22:51.161 --> 00:22:54.498
<i>The subscriber is temporarily unavailable.</i>

287
00:22:54.581 --> 00:22:56.458
<i>Try later...</i>

288
00:22:56.541 --> 00:22:58.460
Haven't unblocked my number yet.

289
00:23:01.129 --> 00:23:02.631
It's cruel.

290
00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:16.395
did you wake up

291
00:23:17.646 --> 00:23:18.480
Yes.

292
00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:20.649
- Hold on.
- Thank you.

293
00:23:35.122 --> 00:23:38.667
When did I get back yesterday?
How did I get home?

294
00:23:40.419 --> 00:23:42.546
You came at two in the morning.

295
00:23:43.672 --> 00:23:45.173
And quite interesting.

296
00:23:46.133 --> 00:23:48.885
"Quite interesting"? That is?

297
00:23:55.517 --> 00:23:56.351
What is it?

298
00:23:58.687 --> 00:23:59.938
It belongs to our neighbor.

299
00:24:03.942 --> 00:24:06.278
- Did I see Mubi yesterday?
- You saw Mubi.

300
00:24:06.361 --> 00:24:08.113
What? As?

301
00:24:08.196 --> 00:24:10.782
No, don't say!

302
00:24:10.866 --> 00:24:13.118
No! say What happened?

303
00:24:13.201 --> 00:24:15.620
No, don't say.

304
00:24:16.204 --> 00:24:17.038
No!

305
00:24:17.914 --> 00:24:20.876
tell me In detail.

306
00:24:29.009 --> 00:24:33.346
<i>You went out late yesterday,</i>
<i>so I woke up and looked out the window.</i>

307
00:24:33.430 --> 00:24:36.183
Please open it. Open it!

308
00:24:36.266 --> 00:24:38.852
<i>Near the neighbors' house</i>
<i>flailed his arms and legs...</i>

309
00:24:40.437 --> 00:24:43.356
Open the door, Mubi!

310
00:24:46.151 --> 00:24:49.362
<i>…boy, similar</i>
<i>on an aerial dancer.</i>

311
00:24:49.446 --> 00:24:50.572
Mubi.

312
00:24:50.655 --> 00:24:52.073
<i>That's why I left immediately.</i>

313
00:24:53.116 --> 00:24:55.202
<i>- And it was you.</i>
- Unblock my number.

314
00:24:56.286 --> 00:24:57.287
<i>However</i>

315
00:24:57.913 --> 00:25:00.415
<i>someone got ahead of me.</i>

316
00:25:00.499 --> 00:25:01.917
<i>Kim Mubi.</i>

317
00:25:03.084 --> 00:25:05.504
Shut up and go away.

318
00:25:05.587 --> 00:25:07.297
Unblock my number.

319
00:25:10.217 --> 00:25:12.636
- Unlock.
- Let go. Let me go!

320
00:25:12.719 --> 00:25:14.721
Unblock my number please.

321
00:25:17.307 --> 00:25:18.808
Unlock while you're here!

322
00:25:29.027 --> 00:25:32.364
Then I picked you up and brought you home.

323
00:25:33.990 --> 00:25:37.744
To be more precise, attracted like a dog.

324
00:25:37.827 --> 00:25:41.581
Chune! I had to be picked up immediately
and not to watch that circus!

325
00:25:41.665 --> 00:25:45.502
You talk a lot of nonsense all the time.
I didn't know you were so drunk.

326
00:25:45.585 --> 00:25:48.713
God, what should I do now?

327
00:25:48.797 --> 00:25:49.756
Who knows

328
00:25:52.175 --> 00:25:55.011
I told her yesterday that you are very sensible.

329
00:25:57.847 --> 00:25:59.182
I will look bad.

330
00:26:01.685 --> 00:26:02.727
It must be her.

331
00:26:03.979 --> 00:26:05.063
Devil!

332
00:26:19.452 --> 00:26:20.495
Give it back

333
00:26:24.666 --> 00:26:27.252
Once again you will get drunk and make a scene -

334
00:26:27.335 --> 00:26:29.087
I'll call the police right away.

335
00:26:29.671 --> 00:26:30.505
Understood

336
00:26:42.726 --> 00:26:43.727
how are you

337
00:26:48.898 --> 00:26:50.442
If you think

338
00:26:51.443 --> 00:26:54.279
she could report me to the police

339
00:26:55.155 --> 00:26:56.823
but did not declare.

340
00:26:57.574 --> 00:27:02.078
Maybe it means
that she doesn't hate me?

341
00:27:04.331 --> 00:27:05.582
You're still drunk.

342
00:27:05.665 --> 00:27:07.083
maybe

343
00:27:07.917 --> 00:27:09.753
I still have a chance.

344
00:27:09.836 --> 00:27:10.837
Gomme.

345
00:27:11.671 --> 00:27:13.256
It's good to be an optimist, but...

346
00:27:13.340 --> 00:27:15.592
First, I need a plan.

347
00:27:16.718 --> 00:27:19.638
I will find Jung Hoo and ask.

348
00:27:25.393 --> 00:27:26.770
He should sober up.

349
00:27:29.564 --> 00:27:31.733
Does he remember or not?

350
00:27:34.653 --> 00:27:35.487
Mubi.

351
00:27:37.280 --> 00:27:39.491
Do you remember Chun San?

352
00:27:40.450 --> 00:27:41.826
This is your father's friend.

353
00:27:43.453 --> 00:27:45.455
Yes, I remember. And what?

354
00:27:45.538 --> 00:27:47.207
He just called.

355
00:27:49.209 --> 00:27:52.420
He said he wanted to
to ask you for a favor.

356
00:27:52.504 --> 00:27:54.756
What does he want from me?

357
00:28:14.275 --> 00:28:16.611
What? Where did he go?

358
00:28:23.201 --> 00:28:25.245
Who this time?

359
00:28:27.956 --> 00:28:30.959
They come and go as they please.

360
00:28:32.252 --> 00:28:33.336
Greetings.

361
00:28:55.775 --> 00:28:57.068
Are you from the store?

362
00:28:59.612 --> 00:29:03.199
what are you doing
Who let you break in here?

363
00:29:03.992 --> 00:29:05.577
Hi Honsi.

364
00:29:06.161 --> 00:29:07.871
I invited her.

365
00:29:08.413 --> 00:29:09.247
What?

366
00:29:16.588 --> 00:29:19.966
I said I would work with you.
But you are crossing the line.

367
00:29:20.049 --> 00:29:22.594
What are the limits? I am here to discuss matters.

368
00:29:22.677 --> 00:29:25.180
Think you can come whenever you want?

369
00:29:27.182 --> 00:29:29.809
- Did you change the number?
- What?

370
00:29:29.893 --> 00:29:31.269
Or you blocked me.

371
00:29:32.520 --> 00:29:35.064
I would warn you
if I could contact you.

372
00:29:36.775 --> 00:29:38.276
Did you block her?

373
00:29:38.359 --> 00:29:42.197
It hurts a lot.
You can't just block...

374
00:29:42.280 --> 00:29:43.198
shut up

375
00:29:48.036 --> 00:29:51.080
Well? What is it? why are you here

376
00:29:52.457 --> 00:29:55.794
we will work together
and we will have to see each other often.

377
00:29:57.253 --> 00:29:59.088
You said you wanted my music.

378
00:29:59.798 --> 00:30:02.634
I will work alone
so let's stay away from each other.

379
00:30:03.802 --> 00:30:05.303
It won't work.

380
00:30:06.346 --> 00:30:07.597
If you read the script,

381
00:30:07.680 --> 00:30:11.518
then you should know that music -
this is the story and the main character.

382
00:30:12.101 --> 00:30:14.145
Therefore, we need to discuss everything.

383
00:30:16.606 --> 00:30:19.108
I read the script.

384
00:30:23.571 --> 00:30:25.698
The music must be unsurpassed.

385
00:30:27.450 --> 00:30:28.576
That's right.

386
00:30:29.160 --> 00:30:32.831
To write such music,
we need to share inspiration

387
00:30:32.914 --> 00:30:34.749
so I will come more often.

388
00:30:37.836 --> 00:30:38.670
"Inspiration"?

389
00:30:39.629 --> 00:30:40.463
"Share"?

390
00:30:42.632 --> 00:30:45.343
I can handle it myself.

391
00:30:46.427 --> 00:30:48.429
Understand me correctly, Xi Chun.

392
00:30:49.013 --> 00:30:50.765
The job is not yours yet.

393
00:30:51.808 --> 00:30:54.894
The director has yet to decide
that music is worth something.

394
00:30:54.978 --> 00:30:57.021
So I have to listen to her.

395
00:30:57.105 --> 00:30:58.273
"Worth something"?

396
00:30:59.274 --> 00:31:01.025
You two need to calm down.

397
00:31:01.109 --> 00:31:04.028
I thought she would just hire
an inexperienced author?

398
00:31:04.571 --> 00:31:08.491
Don't say that. He has experience.

399
00:31:08.575 --> 00:31:10.869
It was you who begged me to work with you.

400
00:31:10.952 --> 00:31:13.830
And you agreed to it, so let's work.

401
00:31:13.913 --> 00:31:15.915
You said you were putting everything on the line.

402
00:31:15.999 --> 00:31:19.794
She is right.
You agreed, so try.

403
00:31:19.878 --> 00:31:20.712
Song Choo A.

404
00:31:20.795 --> 00:31:24.173
Is it because of pride? Are you still not reconciled?

405
00:31:24.257 --> 00:31:26.426
Don't talk like that.

406
00:31:29.012 --> 00:31:32.223
You better go.

407
00:31:32.807 --> 00:31:35.393
I must have lost my mind.
I will not be able to work with you.

408
00:31:35.476 --> 00:31:37.061
No, I'm not going anywhere.

409
00:31:37.145 --> 00:31:38.479
I spoke clearly.

410
00:31:39.147 --> 00:31:42.233
I want to make a movie
and met a worthy director.

411
00:31:42.317 --> 00:31:43.735
I need your music.

412
00:31:44.652 --> 00:31:46.321
I'm not going to back down.

413
00:31:47.655 --> 00:31:49.490
Okay, fight.

414
00:31:49.574 --> 00:31:51.492
You never grew up.

415
00:31:51.576 --> 00:31:53.161
And who is this director?

416
00:31:55.413 --> 00:31:58.499
You think so. It doesn't concern me.

417
00:31:58.583 --> 00:32:00.001
I won't do that.

418
00:32:00.585 --> 00:32:01.461
- You will do it!
- You will do it!

419
00:32:02.921 --> 00:32:05.089
What is the problem?

420
00:32:05.673 --> 00:32:09.177
You have to do it.
You can't turn your nose.

421
00:32:09.260 --> 00:32:13.056
Honsi, come to your senses.
How much longer will you be idle?

422
00:32:13.139 --> 00:32:15.391
Are you telling me to put up with this shit?

423
00:32:16.392 --> 00:32:18.728
Chu Ah, you were too sharp, agree.

424
00:32:18.811 --> 00:32:22.231
- Do you regret what you said?
- Don't climb.

425
00:32:22.315 --> 00:32:27.737
This is a great opportunity for both of you.
Why spoil everything?

426
00:32:27.820 --> 00:32:30.657
If you are an adult, act accordingly.

427
00:32:31.324 --> 00:32:33.159
get up

428
00:32:34.327 --> 00:32:36.371
Shake hands.

429
00:32:36.454 --> 00:32:38.706
Virtual handshake. Now everything is fine.

430
00:32:38.790 --> 00:32:41.292
Let's think about what's next.

431
00:32:41.960 --> 00:32:43.378
Do not climb!

432
00:32:43.461 --> 00:32:44.879
This is our business.

433
00:32:50.802 --> 00:32:51.636
ok

434
00:32:52.762 --> 00:32:55.848
not sure now is the right time

435
00:32:56.724 --> 00:33:00.395
but I'll say it while we're all here together.

436
00:33:04.273 --> 00:33:07.402
I fell in love with someone again.

437
00:33:17.370 --> 00:33:19.998
Thank you for your support. I will do my best.

438
00:33:25.753 --> 00:33:27.088
Invertebrate beetle.

439
00:33:29.257 --> 00:33:31.759
Did he leave his studio?

440
00:33:36.472 --> 00:33:37.890
Obviously, because of me.

441
00:33:37.974 --> 00:33:42.311
That we acted like everything was fine
probably made him angrier.

442
00:33:48.401 --> 00:33:49.986
I want to apologize.

443
00:33:50.069 --> 00:33:52.363
I didn't know what you went through.

444
00:33:54.073 --> 00:33:58.036
It must have been very difficult for you
and I was not around.

445
00:33:59.370 --> 00:34:00.955
I'm sorry I'm serious.

446
00:34:03.624 --> 00:34:05.626
No need to apologize.

447
00:34:06.753 --> 00:34:07.879
I'm fine.

448
00:34:08.755 --> 00:34:11.591
To be honest, it wasn't that difficult.

449
00:34:15.887 --> 00:34:17.221
You better…

450
00:34:23.644 --> 00:34:25.646
tell me about kim mubi.

451
00:34:29.984 --> 00:34:32.111
{\an8}DIRECTOR: KIM MUBY

452
00:34:33.988 --> 00:34:36.240
It was so childish.

453
00:34:40.661 --> 00:34:42.997
And none of them followed me.

454
00:34:48.878 --> 00:34:52.548
Did Golem convince you of this?

455
00:34:53.674 --> 00:34:56.677
And you will give Kim Mubi for this?

456
00:34:56.761 --> 00:34:58.638
I will not give it away.

457
00:34:58.721 --> 00:35:01.641
I will help him just once.
That's all I have to offer.

458
00:35:02.225 --> 00:35:03.059
Cassette.

459
00:35:07.897 --> 00:35:10.191
I didn't watch it when I was little.

460
00:35:10.775 --> 00:35:13.444
Why? Didn't you watch it with your friends?

461
00:35:13.528 --> 00:35:14.570
I had no friends.

462
00:35:15.363 --> 00:35:17.949
None of the boys wanted to play with me.

463
00:35:18.449 --> 00:35:21.452
I had a tube sticking out of it,
and I was very weak.

464
00:35:23.121 --> 00:35:24.372
Is everything good now?

465
00:35:25.373 --> 00:35:27.875
I recovered from a difficult operation.

466
00:35:28.751 --> 00:35:30.211
Am I not healthy?

467
00:35:31.796 --> 00:35:35.216
It hurt so much that I thought:
"It is better to die than to live like this."

468
00:35:36.134 --> 00:35:37.635
But it's good that I persevered.

469
00:35:39.637 --> 00:35:42.723
Only Mubi was friends with me.

470
00:35:43.266 --> 00:35:45.309
I played with her every day

471
00:35:45.893 --> 00:35:50.064
so i watched instead
"Sailor Moon" and "Wedding Peach".

472
00:35:50.898 --> 00:35:54.569
Consider it an honor that I let you
spend a movie day with us.

473
00:35:54.652 --> 00:35:57.405
You should thank me profusely.

474
00:35:59.448 --> 00:36:01.701
In fact, you have a good opportunity.

475
00:36:02.869 --> 00:36:04.579
Just about to tell you or not?

476
00:36:05.496 --> 00:36:07.623
- What is it?
- And what? What is it?

477
00:36:07.707 --> 00:36:09.125
Wait! Gomm!

478
00:36:09.208 --> 00:36:11.127
OK! I will tell!

479
00:36:12.920 --> 00:36:13.921
Good.

480
00:36:14.005 --> 00:36:17.216
We need to arrange a meeting for you.

481
00:36:17.300 --> 00:36:18.134
Yes.

482
00:36:22.138 --> 00:36:23.890
Do I have to tell you?

483
00:36:23.973 --> 00:36:25.725
Tell me while I'm good.

484
00:36:25.808 --> 00:36:26.642
Clear.

485
00:36:27.393 --> 00:36:28.311
Boss

486
00:36:28.394 --> 00:36:29.562
God

487
00:36:37.445 --> 00:36:39.238
<i>That's what your dad always did.</i>

488
00:36:39.739 --> 00:36:42.408
<i>He recently found out that you are a director</i>

489
00:36:42.491 --> 00:36:44.493
<i>and asked very carefully.</i>

490
00:36:50.374 --> 00:36:53.294
<i>If you don't want to, refuse.</i>

491
00:37:03.638 --> 00:37:06.557
Mubi's father was a big movie buff.

492
00:37:07.350 --> 00:37:09.685
He must have rewatched all the movies.

493
00:37:09.769 --> 00:37:13.856
Every year at this time, our community
arranged a movie screening in the open air.

494
00:37:14.565 --> 00:37:17.401
Her dad did the training.

495
00:37:17.485 --> 00:37:18.986
He chose the films himself.

496
00:37:19.654 --> 00:37:21.155
It was cool.

497
00:37:21.656 --> 00:37:23.407
This year too?

498
00:37:24.784 --> 00:37:26.535
I saw the announcement on the pole.

499
00:37:28.079 --> 00:37:30.414
{\an8}28TH SUMMER FILM SHOWING IN DORA FOREST

500
00:37:34.377 --> 00:37:36.003
Take her there?

501
00:37:46.639 --> 00:37:52.728
28TH ANNUAL FILM SHOWING IN DORA FOREST

502
00:37:58.192 --> 00:38:02.363
28TH ANNUAL FILM SHOWING IN DORA FOREST

503
00:38:17.378 --> 00:38:20.965
<i>It was my dad's favorite time of year.</i>

504
00:38:23.134 --> 00:38:26.262
<i>He especially liked to choose films.</i>

505
00:38:26.345 --> 00:38:28.180
What will we show this time?

506
00:38:30.641 --> 00:38:31.726
What do you say?

507
00:38:35.688 --> 00:38:36.856
Here is a good one.

508
00:38:37.940 --> 00:38:40.443
Why hasn't anyone heard of this movie?

509
00:38:42.069 --> 00:38:46.657
<i>He liked to look for films by directors,</i>
<i>which were overlooked.</i>

510
00:38:51.078 --> 00:38:52.413
- Are you not hot?
- No.

511
00:39:00.838 --> 00:39:01.839
Congratulations.

512
00:39:03.007 --> 00:39:06.510
I heard you wanted to show my movie
so I decided to stop by.

513
00:39:06.594 --> 00:39:08.179
Directed by Koo Yeon-sik?

514
00:39:08.262 --> 00:39:09.889
- Yes.
- He is probably a director.

515
00:39:09.972 --> 00:39:11.807
- Thank you for coming.
- Yes.

516
00:39:11.891 --> 00:39:14.101
It's a small event, but people like it.

517
00:39:14.185 --> 00:39:16.020
- Thank you once again.
- Please.

518
00:39:16.896 --> 00:39:18.272
- Nice.
- Yes.

519
00:39:18.356 --> 00:39:19.482
How can I…

520
00:39:22.485 --> 00:39:23.652
Thank you, Mubi.

521
00:39:24.987 --> 00:39:28.491
Please.
You probably didn't lack for work.

522
00:39:28.991 --> 00:39:34.288
It's a pity that your father is gone
to show your film myself.

523
00:39:34.955 --> 00:39:39.627
You know how he loved and was proud of it.

524
00:39:42.797 --> 00:39:46.217
Either way, it's nice to do it again
after so many years.

525
00:39:48.386 --> 00:39:50.221
We will take care of everything else.

526
00:39:50.304 --> 00:39:53.349
Find yourself a good place
and enjoy watching.

527
00:39:53.933 --> 00:39:54.767
OK.

528
00:39:57.353 --> 00:40:00.272
This can be left in the tent.

529
00:40:00.356 --> 00:40:01.690
- There?
- Yes.

530
00:40:02.608 --> 00:40:03.609
why are you here

531
00:40:04.902 --> 00:40:06.070
I am an employee.

532
00:40:15.371 --> 00:40:16.455
Don't pull...

533
00:40:18.332 --> 00:40:20.167
